part bank_2024_12
  tally 2
  note "The prototype's bank history for 2024-12, synthetic (ledger.json, seed 20261017): no bank record was ever used. Written by to_tally.py; links by P1's rule: wynagrodzenie from pracodawca fulfils my_pay of the month before, from pracodawca_zony wife_pay of the month before, czynsz rent_pay of the month; no other row is linked."

